<title>PHILIPPINES: TABLE-PLDT says H1 net at 3.752 bln pesos.</title>
<headline>TABLE-PLDT says H1 net at 3.752 bln pesos.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30</p>
<p>		(in billion pesos unless stated)</p>
<p>Earnings per share (pesos)  27.50  vs  20.99</p>
<p>    Net income			3.752  vs  2.92</p>
<p>Note: Full name is Philippine Long Distance Telephone Co, the Philippine's biggest telecommunications company.</p>
<p>-- Manila Newsroom (63 2) 841-8939 Fax 817--6267</p>
</text>
